# Crater Lair's coolant vat (CIPlay crater_lair_acid, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the recipe:
# the side branch from 6 -21 east to 14 -21, the vat room toward 20 -19; the pool clvatpool and the acid zone cl_vat at
# 18.5 -19.5 (r 2.5, safe=suit); the locker clvatlocker at 20.5 -18.6 behind it; the suit box clvatsuits at 14.6 -22.6 and
# the sign clvatwarn at 14.4 -19.6 by the door. Into the vat without a suit: hurt; out again. Floors ~5 m (a guess).
# Offline-written, never run; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island Crater Lair keep
offset 0.5101 0.0433
hour 11
weather Calm

# (a CI world's bag emptied first: a full bag drops the loot)
empty
walk 9 -36 to 6 -30 to 6 -21 to 13 -21
read VAT ROOM
picture cl_vat_in 13 +2.5 -21 18.5 +0.5 -19.5 light=20
walk 13 -21 to 16 -20.5 to 18.5 -19.5
wait 5
expect message coolant burns
expect hurt 10
walk 18.5 -19.5 to 16 -20.5 to 13 -21
wait 3
expect unhurt
walk 13 -21 to 6 -21 to 6 -30 to 9 -36
